basalt-standalone
Copyright (c) 2026, Mohammadreza (github.com/rafal7466)

The code in include/ and src/ is a C++ port of the visual-inertial odometry of
Basalt (https://gitlab.com/VladyslavUsenko/basalt): the optical flow, IMU
preintegration and sliding-window estimator follow Basalt's algorithms, and
config/euroc_config.txt and config/euroc_ds_calib.txt contain values from
basalt/data/euroc_config.json and basalt/data/euroc_ds_calib.json.
